 "text": "Hi, how have you been? How about a simple dinner together, him saying how much he loves having you part of the family, and you listening for any unspoken needs he might have? Sure thing. I got a wire borne mic and a digital mixer. The mixer allows me to switch between them. Try moving away from the walls and keeping a few feet between you and the source. Body microphones sound better, usually. You see the website, and you use it whenever you log in somewhere. No worries. He probably has several. Ask him which one he uses most, and get that one. It' the one he reaches for automatically that's important.",
